00:35:53.659 --> 00:35:56.909
The best vacuum you will find anywhere.

00:35:58.823 --> 00:36:00.723
Forgot I wrote this.

00:36:00.723 --> 00:36:02.059
I wrote this 30 years ago.

00:36:02.059 --> 00:36:02.892
- That's cool.

00:36:02.892 --> 00:36:04.686
- The best vacuum you will find anywhere,

00:36:04.686 --> 00:36:06.660
according to four out
of five vacuum retailers

00:36:06.660 --> 00:36:09.596
and five out of five astronomers,

00:36:09.596 --> 00:36:13.286
