00:36:42.493 --> 00:36:44.983
there can be no nothing.

00:36:44.983 --> 00:36:46.456
- Wow.

00:36:46.456 --> 00:36:51.419
- Let's call it, we're left
with no choice, nothing nothing.

00:36:51.419 --> 00:36:52.252
- Nothing nothing.

00:36:52.252 --> 00:36:54.419
